sequenceDiagram
  participant Device
  participant API as Sync API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Device->>API: Command batch with device and local sequence
  API->>DB: Validate device session and tenant
  loop Ordered commands
    DB->>DB: Deduplicate command ID
    alt Base version and rule permit
      DB->>DB: Apply command, audit, outbox
      DB-->>API: Applied with server sequence
    else Deterministic no-op
      DB-->>API: Already satisfied
    else Conflict
      DB->>DB: Create sync conflict
      DB-->>API: Conflict type and safe current state
    end
  end
  API-->>Device: Results and new cursor
  Device->>API: Retrieve delta after cursor
  API-->>Device: Versioned changes and tombstones
